sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant F as Security filter chain
    participant M as MVC dispatch
    participant H as Exception handler

    rect rgb(248, 235, 235)
    Note over C,H: 401 -- no session, MVC is never reached
    C->>F: protected route,<br/>no session cookie
    F-->>C: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
    end

    rect rgb(248, 244, 235)
    Note over C,H: 403 -- valid session, someone else's resource
    C->>F: GET /api/boards/{id}/columns
    F->>M: authenticated, forward
    M--xH: ownership check throws
    H-->>C: 403 ACCESS_DENIED
    end

    rect rgb(235, 240, 248)
    Note over C,H: 400 -- body fails validation
    C->>F: POST /api/signup<br/>malformed email
    F->>M: permitAll, forward
    M--xH: binding fails before<br/>the handler body runs
    H-->>C: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED<br/>+ errors map
    end

    rect rgb(238, 248, 238)
    Note over C,H: 409 -- stale version on a concurrent edit
    C->>F: PUT .../tasks/{id}<br/>stale version
    F->>M: authenticated, forward
    M--xH: version differs<br/>from the stored one
    H-->>C: 409 OPTIMISTIC_LOCK_CONFLICT
    end
